<section class="panel" id="tab-validation" data-name="validation">
<h2>Independent validation and robustness</h2>
<p class="lede">Expression differences between tumour and normal kidney are only one kind of evidence, so this tab collects the others: somatic mutation recurrence in {{ layers.mutations.genes | default("—") }} genes across CPTAC and TCGA-KIRC (corrected for gene length), DepMap 26Q1 dependency in {{ (layers.dependency.ccrcc_lines | default([])) | length }} clear cell lines against {{ layers.dependency.other_lines | default("—") }} others, TCGA-KIRC replication ({{ layers.tcga.pairs | default("—") }} tumour-normal pairs) and overall survival ({{ layers.tcga.survival_patients | default("—") }} patients), {{ "{:,}".format(layers.phosphosites.sites) if layers.phosphosites else "—" }} phosphosites turned into kinase activity, and ESTIMATE tumour purity.</p>
{% for p in f.narrative.sections.validation or [] %}
<p class="claim" data-evidence="{{ p.evidence_ids | evattr }}">{{ p.text }} {{ p.evidence_ids | cite | safe }}</p>
{% endfor %}
